{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgDY49zKRt84Y9jXuVVnL", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案:Phil Belanger。**他是 WECA(后来的 Wi-Fi Alliance)的创始成员之一,2005 年 11 月给 Boing Boing 写信,说明 \"Wi-Fi\" 不是任何词语的缩写,本身没有含义。这个名字和阴阳标志都是 Interbrand 想出来的。\n\n有一点我没能核实:搜索结果只称他为\"创始成员\",并说他主持了命名。\"首任主席\"这个头衔,我没在搜到的内容里看到明确写出。除此之外,身份和那封信都对得上。\n\nSources:\n- [Boing Boing: wifi isnt short for (2005-11-08)](https://boingboing.net/2005/11/08/wifi-isnt-short-for.html)\n- [Mental Floss: What Does 'Wi-Fi' Stand For?](https://www.mentalfloss.com/posts/what-does-wi-fi-stand-for)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1611, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5518, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1611}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:04:20.798Z", "request_id": "req_011CgDY49a2iuE2uPpse9wL9"}
